{"id":"0ebe52081fac785e","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure.md","title":"Analytical Classes Are Closed Under Effective Substitution","display":"thm-analytical-reducibility-closure — Analytical Classes Are Closed Under Effective Substitution","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure","aliases":["68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure"],"display":"thm-analytical-reducibility-closure — Analytical Classes Are Closed Under Effective Substitution","depends_on":["[[68-df-effective-real-reducibility]]","[[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]]","[[68-thm-real-substitution]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"19.3 p.74 / PDF 83, explicit correction of printed conclusion","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-typo-documented; substitution-and-prefix-argument-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-analytical-reducibility-closure — Analytical Classes Are Closed Under Effective Substitution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b9d3e17f14fdcab\" href=\"?note=3b9d3e17f14fdcab\" title=\"68-df-effective-real-reducibility\">68-df-effective-real-reducibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4eb7f663287e8b98\" href=\"?note=4eb7f663287e8b98\" title=\"68-df-analytical-hierarchy\">68-df-analytical-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0c57c9ec349151f1\" href=\"?note=0c57c9ec349151f1\" title=\"68-thm-real-substitution\">68-thm-real-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"19.3 p.74 / PDF 83, explicit correction of printed conclusion"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-typo-documented; substitution-and-prefix-argument-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k,r,l\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,k,r,l\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X_{m,k}\">\\(R\\subseteq X_{m,k}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq X_{r,l}\">\\(S\\subseteq X_{r,l}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\le_{\\mathrm{eff}}^{(m,k;r,l)}S\">\\(R\\le_{\\mathrm{eff}}^{(m,k;r,l)}S\\)</span>。有效代入见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b9d3e17f14fdcab\" href=\"?note=3b9d3e17f14fdcab\" title=\"68-df-effective-real-reducibility\">68-df-effective-real-reducibility</a>，解析类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4eb7f663287e8b98\" href=\"?note=4eb7f663287e8b98\" title=\"68-df-analytical-hierarchy\">68-df-analytical-hierarchy</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(S\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(r,l)}\\Rightarrow R\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(S\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(r,l)}\\Rightarrow R\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(S\\in\\Delta_n^{1,(r,l)}\\Rightarrow R\\in\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(S\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(r,l)}\\Rightarrow R\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(S\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(r,l)}\\Rightarrow R\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(S\\in\\Delta_n^{1,(r,l)}\\Rightarrow R\\in\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>PDF83实际印刷19.3写“If P is … and Q is reducible to P, then P is …”，结论重复P。这里将源P对应S、源Q对应R，显式改正结论为R保留同层级。18.2保证递归矩阵在全递归代入下仍递归，19.1把量词前缀正规化，从而得到正确的向下闭包；Δ情形同时应用Σ和Π两侧。这是有来源位置和推导依据的本地勘误，不把印刷错误当作有信息量的定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-effective-real-reducibility","status":"resolved","id":"3b9d3e17f14fdcab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-effective-real-reducibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-analytical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"4eb7f663287e8b98","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-real-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"0c57c9ec349151f1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-real-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-effective-real-reducibility","status":"resolved","id":"3b9d3e17f14fdcab","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$，$m,k,r,l\\in\\mathbb N$，$R\\subseteq X_{m,k}$，$S\\subseteq X_{r,l}$，$R\\le_{\\mathrm{eff}}^{(m,k;r,l)}S$。有效代入见 [[68-df-effective-real-reducibility]]，解析类见 [[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-analytical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"4eb7f663287e8b98","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$，$m,k,r,l\\in\\mathbb N$，$R\\subseteq X_{m,k}$，$S\\subseteq X_{r,l}$，$R\\le_{\\mathrm{eff}}^{(m,k;r,l)}S$。有效代入见 [[68-df-effective-real-reducibility]]，解析类见 [[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"m,k,r,l\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X_{m,k}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq X_{r,l}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\le_{\\mathrm{eff}}^{(m,k;r,l)}S","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl(S\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(r,l)}\\Rightarrow R\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(S\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(r,l)}\\Rightarrow R\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(S\\in\\Delta_n^{1,(r,l)}\\Rightarrow R\\in\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1814,"backlinks":[{"id":"038e64585683402b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9a4f932ed500c2b4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"94e1d47d7b40b77a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"§10 的 SG_68 包含单位元；§20 的 SigmaRing 要求包含全集并对相对补集闭合，均沿用本书精确定义。原包关于 19.3 与 20.5 的勘误记录分别见 [[68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure]]、[[68-thm-separation-theorem]]；本次未重新核对未随附件提供的原书 PDF。"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-110","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-157","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure|thm-analytical-reducibility-closure — Analytical Classes Are Closed Under Effective Substitution]]"}],"outgoing":["3b9d3e17f14fdcab","4eb7f663287e8b98","0c57c9ec349151f1"]}